WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.800
In a quiet room, a teenager tells
a priest what she has done wrong.

2
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.750
The priest may never reveal what he hears.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.700
Not to anyone, for any reason.

4
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.170
Yet Catholics agree with a
question asked in the Gospels:

5
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.140
who can forgive sins but God alone?

6
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:22.920
So if only God can forgive sins, why
do Catholics confess them to a priest?

7
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:26.730
In this mission, you'll follow
the four parts of reconciliation,

8
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.140
from sorrow to absolution.

9
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.630
Then you'll meet the other
sacraments of healing and service:

10
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.200
anointing the sick,
marriage and ordination.

11
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.120
Your mission: find out why
Catholics confess to a priest,

12
00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.030
if only God can forgive.
